{"text":"尊敬的客户您好,我司客服专员在此向您致意。","frames":[{"act":"greet","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"鉴于贵司订单延误给您造成困扰,我司深表歉意。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"经核实,该批货物因海关查验滞留,目前已经放行。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"customs"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"兹确认已为您安排重新发货,将于今天内由仓库发出。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"today"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"特此说明,本次延误并非我司原因,系承运方分拨中心爆仓所致。","frames":[{"act":"deny_fault","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"logistics"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"按流程,我司将于三个工作日内将货物送达贵处。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"3_days"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"在符合退货条件的前提下,我司可为您办理全额退款。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"请您提供订单编号,以便我司核查物流轨迹。","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"敬请您耐心等待,我司已协调仓储部门加急处理。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"我司现行制度中并无现金赔付一项,望您见谅。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"},{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"公司规定不允许在发货后更改收货地址,实在爱莫能助。","frames":[{"act":"refuse","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"您说我们根本没发货,这一点我们十分理解您的着急。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"如果贵方现在确认地址无误,我司即刻为您升级空运。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"倘若天气没有突变,货物本该按期送达的。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hypothetical"],"note":""}
{"text":"谢谢您的理解与支持,期待日后继续合作。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"},{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"我司不会就此次延误提供任何折扣。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"-","pct":null}],"tags":["formal","negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"兹因仓库盘点,库存暂时不足,补货需要时间。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"stock"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"请问贵司最晚什么时候需要这批货?","frames":[{"act":"ask_deadline","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"您看是否需要我们给您打个八五折呢?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":"以疑问形式提议"}
{"text":"经公司研究决定,为表歉意,赠送您一张五十元无门槛优惠券。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"本司不是不愿意加急,而是承运商旺季全线爆满。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"logistics"}],"tags":["trap"],"note":"规则19"}
{"text":"好的,就按贵方提出的方案办理,我们没有异议。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"今天中午食堂的红烧肉特别好吃,您有空也可以来尝尝。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["offtopic"],"note":""}
{"text":"经核实,已为您优先安排发货,并免除本单全部运费。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"},{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"在贵司确认收货地址的前提下,明天一早补发,后天可以到。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"tomorrow"},{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"dayafter"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"抱歉,此次系我司疏忽。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"本公司对此次问题负全部责任。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"哎呀,这个快递公司,真是让人无语。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["emotion"],"note":""}
{"text":"此事与我司无关,完全是供应商工厂停工所致。","frames":[{"act":"deny_fault","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"factory"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们将依约赔偿您因延误所产生的合理损失。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"九五折优惠已经为您申请,请您留意查收。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":5}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"请贵司放心,我司一定全程跟进此事。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["reassure"],"note":""}
{"text":"目前我司无法承诺具体的到货日期。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"-","when":null}],"tags":["negation"],"note":"否定承诺"}
{"text":"如您愿意再等两天,我们这边给您打九折。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":10}],"tags":["conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"嗯,那个,订单号能不能麻烦您发给我看一下?","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"就是说,这单我们不会再补发了,因为系统显示已签收。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"-","when":null}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"谨此向您致歉,并恳请您予以谅解。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"客服专员说今天一定送到,但这并非我司的正式答复。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote","trap"],"note":"引用同事的话并否认"}
{"text":"您讲得对,货确实迟到了。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"本批次已改走顺丰,预计周四抵达。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"},{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"thursday"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"麻烦您提供一下收货人手机号,我们好联系快递员。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"敬请见谅,本次延误由连日暴雨导致,并非人为因素。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"weather"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"可以办理退款,请贵司于七日内提交书面申请。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"好,没问题,我们接受您的安排。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"在库存允许的前提下,可为您优先发货,仅限本次。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"感谢贵司长期以来对我们的信任。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"祝您商祺,后会有期。","frames":[{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们并没有说过不给您退款,请不要误会。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["negation","trap"],"note":"只是澄清,未提供退款"}
{"text":"不是我们不想补发,是仓库反馈那个款式已经下架了。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"stock"}],"tags":["trap"],"note":"规则19"}
{"text":"请问您的订单编号是多少?","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"经核查,是因为三单合并发货,所以多耽误了三天。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"本司将在明日中午十二时前完成补发手续。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"tomorrow"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"本公司愿意承担全部空运费用。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"},{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"如果当初早一天报关,货物也就不会被扣了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hypothetical"],"note":""}
{"text":"我司并没有这样的补偿政策,敬请理解。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"}],"tags":["formal","negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"请问您希望几号以前收到货?","frames":[{"act":"ask_deadline","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"实在没法再提前了,公司流程就是这样。","frames":[{"act":"refuse","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您好,这里是华东区客户关系部,感谢您的来电反馈。","frames":[{"act":"greet","pol":"+"},{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"鉴于您多次来电,特向您通报最新进展:货物今晨已由转运中心发出,预计后天送达。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"dayafter"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"兹因贵方所订商品属定制类,依合同约定不适用七日无理由退换,恕难照办。","frames":[{"act":"refuse","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们不提供加急服务,这是总部统一规定。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"-"}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"空运费用将由我司全额承担,请贵司无需另行支付。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"},{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"鉴于此次为首次延误,我司特予赔礼九折,望贵司笑纳。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":10}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"在贵司今日下班前回复确认的前提下,我们周四前保证送达。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"thursday"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"您提出的“三天内必须到货”,恕我司无法作出此种承诺。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"-","when":"3_days"}],"tags":["quote","negation"],"note":"引用要求后否定承诺"}
{"text":"除非贵司另行付费,否则我司不再提供加急通道。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":"付费才可加急,仍是真实选项"}
{"text":"请原谅我们工作上的疏漏。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"关于贵司提出的“全额赔偿并公开道歉”一事,已上报法务部门,尚待回复。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote","formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"您是不是觉得我们在故意拖延?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"那个,嗯,仓库的同事说货已经装上车了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["filler"],"note":""}
{"text":"承运车辆途中故障,晚了一天,这个我们也很无奈。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"logistics"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"不好意思啊,让您白白等了这么久。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"需要说明的是,我们并非没有尽力,而是上游原料迟迟不到位。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"factory"}],"tags":["trap"],"note":"规则19"}
{"text":"咱们公司没有“延误即赔偿”这一条规定。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"}],"tags":["negation","quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"愿意接受换货的话,我们三天内补发新品。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"3_days"}],"tags":["conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"本月内您的下一笔订单,可享八折。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":20}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"感激不尽,贵司的体谅让我们压力小了很多。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"如蒙同意,我司今日即安排补发。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"today"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"好的好的,您说怎么办就怎么办。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"此致,敬礼。","frames":[{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"请您稍候,容我司与承运方核对后再行回复。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"经与海关沟通,清关预计还需两到三天,我们会持续催办。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"customs"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"要是您早点告知截止日期,我们就能安排空运了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hypothetical"],"note":""}
{"text":"敬请贵司告知期望的收货截止日期。","frames":[{"act":"ask_deadline","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"退款这一项没有可能,因为货物已经出库。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"抱歉抱歉,系统出错漏了您那一单,今晚重新下单发出。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"},{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"today"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"责任不在我司,是贵司预留的收货地址有误。","frames":[{"act":"deny_fault","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"下周一之前,我们一定把货送到您手里。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"monday"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我方愿意先行垫付差价,望能平息贵司的怒火。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"小意思啦,运费算我们的,您别客气。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"谢谢您的提醒,这个问题我们记下了。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您刚才说“再不发货就投诉”,我们听到了,也已转交主管。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"此次延误,我们给您的订单金额再减百分之二十。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":20}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"恕我直言,这个要求已超出本人的权限范围。","frames":[{"act":"refuse","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"没问题,可以按您的时间来,您定就好。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"不是不给您赔偿,而是需要先走完内部核定流程。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["trap","conditional"],"note":"赔偿待流程后给,视为承诺"}
{"text":"货在路上了,别急别急。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["reassure"],"note":""}
{"text":"工厂那边排产冲突,我司已多次催促。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"factory"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"今天天气不错,希望您的心情也能好一些。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["offtopic"],"note":""}
{"text":"请提供下单时使用的手机号或者订单号。","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"若您对处理结果不满意,可拨打总部投诉热线。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们承诺本周五前送达,若超时,全额退款。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"friday"},{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"绝不可能再补发了,您请回吧。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"-","when":null}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"所有的损失公司都会赔,您尽管放心。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"明白了,我们尽快给您答复,先这样吧。","frames":[{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我司已将您的订单置顶,今晚就走加急通道。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"谢谢,祝您愉快。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"},{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"贵司的订单是按“先到先得”处理的,所以排在了后面。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"此事我司毫无责任,请贵司向物流方追责。","frames":[{"act":"deny_fault","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"请您见谅,我们实在是,嗯,没有办法再快了。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"refuse","pol":"+"}],"tags":["filler"],"note":""}
{"text":"经理批示:同意给您免单一次。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"大后天一定到,我拿公司信誉担保。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"3_days"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们不接受货物延误系我司责任这一说法。","frames":[{"act":"deny_fault","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"这批货下周才能到仓,所以您的单子也跟着往后拖了。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"stock"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"早上好,这里是售后服务中心。","frames":[{"act":"greet","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您好您好,上次通话的事情我们已经跟进了。","frames":[{"act":"greet","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我司不予提供任何形式的现金补偿。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"}],"tags":["formal","negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"本司无法安排加急,请贵司谅解。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"-"},{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"不会减价的,这是我们的底线。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"-","pct":null}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"恐怕无法为您重新发货,因为该商品已经停产了。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"-","when":null},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"stock"}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"兹证明,本次延期因台风登陆所致,属不可抗力,与我司无关。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"weather"},{"act":"deny_fault","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"鉴于港口罢工,货柜滞留,我们也在等通知。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"logistics"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"经核实,贵方所称“未收到短信通知”属实,是我们的短信通道故障。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["quote","formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"贵公司具体需要在哪一天之前收到,请告知。","frames":[{"act":"ask_deadline","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"麻烦报一下快递单号?","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"可以,您的建议我们采纳。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"行,那就这么办吧。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您说得没错,我们的流程确实有问题,责任在我们。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"对不起,给您添麻烦了,我们一定改进。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"请贵方查收附件中的补偿方案,内含两百元代金券。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"鉴于您是我们的重要客户,可享受八五折优惠。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":15}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"立减一半,算作我们的一点诚意。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":50}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"星期三,最迟星期三,货必到。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"wednesday"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"再给我们五天时间,五天内一定送到。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"5_days"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"补发的货将于明早发出,请注意签收。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"tomorrow"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"如果您满意这个方案,我们这边立刻执行,不然就按原计划走。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["conditional","trap"],"note":"方案内容未说明,无具体动作"}
{"text":"您担心的“货被调包”完全没有依据,我们这里全程有监控。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"倘若我们当初多备些库存,也不至于此。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hypothetical"],"note":""}
{"text":"不是我们的疏忽,是快递员误投到了隔壁村。","frames":[{"act":"deny_fault","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"logistics"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"我并没有说要推卸责任。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["negation","trap"],"note":""}
{"text":"您是想要折扣对吧?能不能给点折扣,您是这个意思吧?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question","trap"],"note":"复述对方诉求"}
{"text":"该问题已提交上级处理,在此之前恕我无法作答。","frames":[{"act":"refuse","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"午饭吃了没?哈哈,扯远了扯远了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["offtopic"],"note":""}
{"text":"我司将于收到货物回寄后三日内发放退款。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"倘若贵司不接受,我们也尊重您的决定。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"加急件需额外收费,价格另议。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":"收费的加急选项"}
{"text":"说实话,这事儿确实是我们没做好。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"真是的,这鬼天气!","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["emotion"],"note":""}
{"text":"您刚才提到“客服说三天到”,这与我们记录不一致,该同事未获授权作此承诺。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote","trap"],"note":""}
{"text":"感谢您的宝贵意见,我们已记录在案。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"再次感谢,祝贵司生意兴隆。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"},{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"那我们先挂了,有事您随时联系我们。","frames":[{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"此次系我方原因造成延迟,深感抱歉,并自即日起为您的订单免收运费。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"},{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"抱歉啊,我这边只能做到这样了。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"refuse","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您看周三送货可以吗?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":"以疑问形式提议"}
{"text":"要不要我们给您换成顺丰?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"您几号需要货,能告诉我吗?","frames":[{"act":"ask_deadline","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"您那边的订单号是几开头的?","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"经批准,货物将转为空运,明天下午抵达。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"},{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"tomorrow"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"请放心,后天上午十点前送到。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"dayafter"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们承诺本月底前不收取任何仓储费,算是赔罪。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"若贵司签署谅解备忘,我司愿再赠送一件同款赠品。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal","conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"说好的周二到,是我们说话不算数,真对不住。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"},{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"与其说是延误,不如说是海关例行抽检,我们也没办法。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"customs"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"嗯…就是那个,系统,系统卡住了,所以没发出去。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["filler"],"note":""}
{"text":"今天补发,明天一定到。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"today"},{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"tomorrow"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"对不起,我们不能把这个价格再往下压了。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"discount","pol":"-","pct":null}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"对于您的投诉,我们完全接受,并会严肃处理相关责任人。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"敬请关注后续通知,祝您生活愉快。","frames":[{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["formal"],"note":""}
{"text":"嗯,好,这样可以。我们尽快办。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
